  "$comment": "What stage-candidates.mjs copies or converts into client/public/art/_candidates/ for the ?art&candidates gallery. source is a path inside art-src/<pack>/content/. role is a WeaponKind name for guns, a map kind for map pieces, an effect use for sprites and a surface for textures. length (guns) is the length in metres the gallery scales the model to; target (map pieces) is the box [length, height, depth] in metres the server uses for that kind. notes are shown in the gallery. flip turns a gun end for end when its muzzle is at its negative end; turn [x, y, z] in degrees replaces the automatic side-view turn. luminanceAlpha makes a grey-on-black sprite white with the grey as its alpha.",
